# Runtime state written by the plugin itself.
#
# The thinking log is the most private thing this plugin produces: it stores the
# driver's reasoning, every tool name, and file paths from the user's real
# conversations. It is written to the profile directory, never to this repo, but
# an ignore rule costs nothing and a stray `cp -r` should not be able to publish it.
.one-click-polish-log.json
.one-click-polish-autopilot.json
.one-click-polish*.json

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Packed artifacts
*.tgz
dist/
